  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nHero and all companions gain
    5% movement speed per talent. Applies while owned, subject to final speed limits.\r\n\nSUPPORT
    WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Critical chance: +1%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier
    1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE
    IN THE WAITING REALM\nA guard bound to the promise that nobody would leave alone,
    they trapped solitary travellers. Someone returned voluntarily for them. The
    contract erased that night, but their body still moves to cover a companion's
    unguarded left side.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: frost, hare, root. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
